    "expectedRule": "Dream Archive sealing starts empty; the first dangerous (monster or trap) node clear seals consumables, the second seals methods, the third seals pets, in the fixed order consumable->method->pet, and no fourth feature is ever sealed. Clearing an index node (index_reward or cracked_core_index_reward) or resolving the failure_index dungeon event successfully resets sealedFeatures to empty. While a feature is sealed, combat use of that feature is refused (healing pill: '梦档案馆已封存消耗品，止血丹暂时无法使用。'; art: '梦档案馆已封存功法，本场暂时无法运转术法。') without advancing the turn, the active pet stops assisting in combat, and route gates archive_consumable_librarian_spine, archive_method_ink_spine, and archive_pet_portal_spine close with '先到索引柜或裂核索引解除封存。' until the corresponding reset. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
